p></div></div></div></section>\n<section><div class=\"w c\"><span class=\"eye\">How it works</span><h2>From First Call to More Walk-Ins</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><b>1</b><h4>Free Clinic Review</h4><p>With as little as 1 hour’s notice by Zoom, Google Meet or in person, subject to availability.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><b>2</b><h4>Fix the Foundation</h4><p>Listings, hours, check-in links, speed, tracking and technical errors.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><b>3</b><h4>Build Visibility</h4><p>Location, service and condition pages, schema, AI-ready answers and reviews.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><b>4</b><h4>Launch Ads</h4><p>Location-targeted Google Ads where they make sense for your market.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><b>5</b><h4>Measure &amp; Grow</h4><p>Calls, check-ins, direction requests and visibility tracked month to month.</p></div></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"padding:40px 0\"><div class=\"w\"><div class=\"band orange\"><div><span class=\"e\">Growth Target</span><h3>10–50% Growth Target for Established Clinics in 2 Months</h3><p>We fix what’s holding you back across Google, Maps, AI assistants and Ads, then measure the change in calls, check-ins and qualified traffic. Results vary by market and starting point.</p><ul><li>No upfront charge</li><li>Pay only after the work is done</li><li>Nationwide since 2013</li></ul></div><div class=\"a\"><a class=\"btn bp\" data-cta=\"uc-band2\" href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjI1NDQ5NyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9\">Start My Free Clinic Review →</a><a class=\"btn bs\" data-cta=\"uc-band2-call\" href=\"tel:+18322667209\">📞 Call 832-266-7209</a></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"lav\"><div class=\"w c\"><span class=\"eye\">Transparent pricing</span><h2>Plans Start at $750/Month, Month to Month</h2><p class=\"lead\">No advance payment, no deposit and no long-term contract. You pay only after the work is done, and you can cancel with 7 days’ notice.</p